                                                "sense_id": "b9339efc-af17-3d7d-bb51-e16a28b1b16d",
                                                "text": "Here are a few examples of \"spectaculars,\" or three-dimensional pieces, including those which have won awards […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
